        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-left:40pt; margin-top:8pt; width:416pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Binding Organizational Documents Proposal A:</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;a proposal to approve the change in authorized share capital of JATT, from US$22,100 divided into 200,000,000 Class&#160;A Ordinary Shares of a par </font>
        </div>
      </div>
