          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">During the Interim Period, JATT has also agreed not to, and to cause Merger Sub not to, except as otherwise contemplated by the Business Combination Agreement (including in connection with the Merger) or the ancillary agreements entered into in connection with the Business Combination, as consented to by Zura in writing (which consent will not be unreasonably withheld, conditioned or delayed) or as required by applicable law: </font>
