          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">owned by, or leased or licensed to, SPAC or Merger Sub, except for Permitted Liens, Liens under existing credit facilities or other Indebtedness permitted pursuant to,and as required or contemplated by, the Business Combination Agreement;</font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:5.71pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
