          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">JATT had an aggregate of 12,810,000 warrants outstanding which had no intrinsic value and were anti-dilutive. Additionally, Zura had stock options on 3,547 and <font style="white-space:nowrap;">-0-</font> shares as of September&#160;30, 2022 and December&#160;31, 2021, respectively, which had no intrinsic value and were anti-dilutive. </font>
