        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">For the six&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022, the weighted-average grant date fair value of the US Options was $64.40. There were no grants of stock options during the three&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022. </font>
        </div>
